    "file_overlap": "per commit: the fraction of its files that at least one other commit in the batch also touches",
    "touch_rate": "per distinct file in the batch: the number of commits touching it divided by the number of commits in the batch",
    "moments": "m1, m2 and m3 are the raw moments (mean of x, x squared, x cubed) of each distribution over its population: commits for commit_size and file_overlap, distinct files for touch_rate"
